pass-secret-service (0~git20260715.4ba0f4b6-2) trixie; urgency=high

  * Add Conflicts/Replaces: gnome-keyring (found during live testing):
    both packages ship the same D-Bus activation file
    (usr/share/dbus-1/services/org.freedesktop.secrets.service) for the
    same well-known bus name — they cannot coexist, and dpkg refuses to
    silently overwrite a file owned by another package. Replacing
    gnome-keyring's Secret Service role was always the intent (see
    CLAUDE.md); it just wasn't declared.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Thu, 16 Jul 2026 15:00:00 -0500

pass-secret-service (0~git20260715.4ba0f4b6-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging. Builds upstream develop branch snapshot (commit
