    upstream has no tagged releases. Part of the PaperweightOS
    secrets-manager stack (pass + pass-secret-service + pam-gnupg).
  * Installs upstream's systemd/dbus service-activation files, with
    ExecStart corrected from /usr/local/bin to /usr/bin.

